  "content": "<h5><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Yh9O6WH.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"191\" height=\"34\"></strong></h5><h5><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>⚔️ 全面翻新的世界生成（<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/oh-the-biomes-youll-go\" rel=\"nofollow\">Oh The Biomes You'll Go</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geophilic\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Geophilic</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ecologics\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ecologics</a>）</strong></span></h5><h5><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>⚔️ 完整優化，支援光影著色器</strong></span></h5><h5><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>⚔️ 超過150個任務</strong></span></h5><h5><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>⚔️ 30+種起源</strong></span></h5><h5><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>⚔️ 6個全新維度</strong></span></h5><h5><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>⚔️ RPG要素，例如<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/playerex\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">等級系統</a>與<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dungeon-difficulty\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">怪物強度調整</a></strong></span></h5><h5><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>⚔️ 具挑戰性的獨特Boss（<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/adventurez\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">AdventureZ</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bosses-of-mass-destruction\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bosses of Mass Destruction</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mariums-soulslike-weaponry\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Soulslike Weaponry</a>）</strong></span></h5><h5><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>⚔️ <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dehydration\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">口渴度</a>與<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/environmentz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">溫度系統</a></strong></span></h5><h5><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>⚔️ 數千個全新地牢與建築（<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/when-dungeons-arise-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">When Dungeons Arise</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/choicetheorems-overhauled-village\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Overhauled Villages</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/repurposed-structures-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Repurposed Structures</a>）</strong></span></h5><h5><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>⚔️ 高度自訂化，確保模組整合與相容性</strong></span></h5><h5><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>⚔️ 沉浸式功能，強化角色扮演與成長</strong></span></h5><h5><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>⚔️ 生活品質功能，如<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-waystones\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">傳送石碑</a>與<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/xp-obelisk\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">經驗方尖碑</a></strong></span></h5><h5><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>⚔️ <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/journeymap\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">JourneyMap</a>加入新功能（<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/journeymap-integration\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">JourneyMap Integration</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mapfrontiers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Map Frontiers</a>）</strong></span></h5><h5><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>⚔️ <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.modpackindex.com%252fmodpack%252f32754%252fmedieval-mc-fabric-mmc1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">330+個模組</a></strong></span></h5><p><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/790272037578473512?label=Discord&amp;color=393939&amp;labelColor=0843bf&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"235\" height=\"32\"></p><p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/stoegRhDQxY?wmode=transparent\" width=\"410\" height=\"230\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/4cwnhnrcCUw?wmode=transparent\" width=\"410\" height=\"230\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><h5 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>非官方Minecraft產品。未經Mojang或Microsoft認可或與其相關。</strong></span></h5>",
